cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RoutineOS, please cite it as below."
title: "RoutineOS: the self-improving framework for Claude routines"
type: software
authors:
  - name: Devkind
version: 0.11.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/devkindhq/routineos"
url: "https://docs.routineos.org"
abstract: >-
  RoutineOS is a Claude Code plugin for Claude routines (Claude Code
  scheduled tasks). It gives each routine typed settings, a linter,
  templates, approval gates and a mobile Desk. A routine proposes changes
  to its own settings from the evidence of your decisions and applies them
  only when you say yes.
keywords:
  - claude
  - claude-code
  - claude-code-plugin
  - scheduled-tasks
  - ai-agents
  - workflow-automation
  - human-in-the-loop
